{
  "name": "LOPEST - Salud diaria",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000001",
      "name": "Schedule - Diaria 7:00"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f0000a1",
              "name": "baseUrl",
              "value": "https://CONFIGURAR-DOMINIO-LOPEST",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f0000a2",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "value": "CONFIGURAR-CHAT-ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000003",
      "name": "Set - Config"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.baseUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/api/salud",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        100
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000004",
      "name": "HTTP - GET /api/salud",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "/**\n * Transports, does not decide twice: /api/salud already computed `estado`.\n * This node only turns the HTTP outcome into one alert-ready message.\n *\n * Fails the check when: the request did not return 200, the body is not the\n * expected JSON, or `estado` is not \"ok\" (\"degradado\" = a cron looks late).\n * A network error arrives here too (HTTP node continues on error) with no\n * statusCode, so it is reported as \"sin respuesta\".\n */\nconst res = $input.first().json;\nconst chatId = $('Set - Config').first().json.telegramChatId;\nconst status = Number(res.statusCode ?? 0);\nconst body = res.body && typeof res.body === \"object\" ? res.body : null;\nconst estado = body?.estado ?? \"sin_respuesta\";\n\nconst problems = [];\nif (status !== 200) problems.push(`HTTP ${status || \"sin respuesta\"}`);\nif (!body) problems.push(\"respuesta sin JSON\");\nif (body && body.baseDeDatos?.ok !== true) problems.push(\"base de datos no responde\");\nif (body?.crons?.vencidas?.ok === false) {\n  problems.push(`cron de vencidas atrasado (${body.crons.vencidas.pendientesVencidasFueraDeTolerancia} cuotas pendientes fuera de tolerancia)`);\n}\nif (body?.crons?.driveSincronizacion?.ok === false) {\n  problems.push(`sincronizacion Drive sin correr hace ${body.crons.driveSincronizacion.horasDesdeUltimaVerificacion} h`);\n}\n\nconst ok = status === 200 && estado === \"ok\";\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ok,\n    estado,\n    chatId,\n    mensaje: ok\n      ? \"Lopest OK\"\n      : `LOPEST - Salud diaria: ${estado}. ${problems.join(\"; \") || \"revisar /api/salud\"}. Commit: ${body?.version?.commit ?? \"desconocido\"}.`,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        100
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000005",
      "name": "Code - Evaluar Respuesta"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f0000b1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "false",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        100
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000006",
      "name": "IF - Falla"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LOPEST - Salud diaria\n\nUna vez al día, 7:00 en Bogotá (zona horaria del workflow), después de los crons de madrugada.\n\n1. `Set - Config`: `baseUrl` = dominio público de Lopest; `telegramChatId` = chat que recibe la alerta.\n2. Consulta `GET /api/salud` (público, sin secretos; 3 intentos). Un error de red sigue al nodo de evaluación.\n3. Si no responde 200 con `estado: ok`, avisa por Telegram y marca la ejecución como fallida.\n\n**Credencial:** `Telegram - Avisar Falla` usa la credencial n8n *Telegram Bot Lopest* (token de BotFather). El token nunca va en este JSON.\n\nErrores del propio workflow: *Settings → Error workflow* = «LOPEST - Alertas de errores a Telegram».\n\nSin fallas: silencio.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000008",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.mensaje }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000009",
      "name": "Telegram - Avisar Falla",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURAR",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Lopest"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "={{ $('Code - Evaluar Respuesta').first().json.mensaje }}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ],
      "id": "9d3c1a20-4b7e-4f51-8a10-6c2e1f000007",
      "name": "Stop - Marcar Falla"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
